methylgrapher (mojo-align package)
=================================

This directory contains the methylGrapher-derived science and orchestration
code (PrepareGenome / Align / MethylCall / MergeCpG / ConversionRate and the
Python `engine/` port of upstream methylGrapher 0.2.0).

